---
description: Concise best practices for accessible Radix UI component implementation.
globs: components/**/*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx}, app/**/*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx}
---
- **Use Radix UI Primitives:** Build custom components with accessible Radix UI primitives.
- **Follow Radix UI Accessibility Guides:** Adhere to Radix UI's accessibility guidelines for all components.
- **Radix UI Composition & Variants:** Leverage composition patterns and variants for complex UI elements.
- **Keyboard Navigation Support:** Ensure full keyboard navigation for all components.
- **Correct ARIA Attributes:** Verify proper ARIA attribute usage in components.
